  "Controlled ablations in several document and spreadsheet benchmarks show benefits from preserving spatial, hierarchical, or explicit structural information, while TAPAS preserves row-column structure without the supplied analysis establishing a direct row-column-structure ablation effect [2106.11539, 2010.12537, 2412.18424, 2604.12282, 2608.03292, doi-10-18653-v1-2020-acl-main-398].",
